## 3. Findings in one paragraph each

- **RQ1.** On the official test split, character-n-gram TF-IDF models ({{ v.mc7_test.mc7_tfidf_svm.macro_f1 }}) and
  HingRoBERTa ({{ v.mc7_test.mc7_hingroberta_base.macro_f1 }}) outperform MuRIL ({{ v.mc7_test.mc7_muril_base.macro_f1 }})
  and XLM-R ({{ v.mc7_test.mc7_xlmr_base.macro_f1 }}). On validation all are close. The official test split is
  distribution-shifted (domain-classifier AUC {{ v.shift.train_vs_test }} vs. {{ v.shift.train_vs_val }} control).
